sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant Panel as Panel (browser)
  participant Eng as Engine
  participant Dir as Director (model)
  participant Tool as Scripts: TTS, Whisper, ffmpeg

  You->>Panel: accept voice-over v2
  Panel->>Eng: POST approve
  Eng->>Eng: record the acceptance
  Eng-->>Dir: [demo-panel] voice-over v2 APPROVED (a turn)
  Dir-->>You: "ready to generate the voice: use the panel button"
  You->>Panel: Generate voice & render
  Panel->>Eng: POST vo-generate (no confirm)
  Eng->>Eng: estimate the cost
  Eng-->>Panel: estimate popup
  You->>Panel: Generate
  Panel->>Eng: POST vo-generate (confirm)
  Eng-->>Dir: quiet note: started from the panel
  Eng->>Tool: TTS job: ElevenLabs, Whisper timings
  Tool-->>Eng: audio and word timings
  Eng->>Tool: edit job: ffmpeg draft render
  Tool-->>Eng: timeline v2 and draft
  Eng-->>Panel: events to the Live log and progress
  Eng-->>Dir: edit report (a turn)
  alt a model is set for the Annotation designer
    Eng->>Eng: design job: one call
    Eng-->>Dir: quiet note: annotations v1 suggested by model X
  else the role has no model
    Dir->>Eng: demo_rec_annotations context, then suggest
  end
  Eng-->>Panel: annotations v1
  You->>Panel: toggle, edit, accept
